	"BattleCommand", -- (action:string, a:any, b:any)  Phase 5: Attack / Element / Special / Dash / Target / Buff / Swap / Cheer / Retreat / Engage (boss raids) / Forfeit
	"BattleRequest", -- (action:string, a:any, b:any)  TeamSet / TeamSelect / Challenge / ChallengeReply / Queue / Unqueue / RaidDare (tierId) / LeaveRaid / Ring (Phase 4: startRound); Phase 5: Trial is gone
	"ArenaState", -- server -> client (state:table)  next event, countdown, raid status, leaderboard
	-- Phase 5 (ARCHITECTURE_V3.md "Phase 5 build contract" 5.7, 6.3, 7.2)
	"DungeonRequest", -- (action:string, a:any, b:any)  Open / Create (floor) / Join (leaderUserId) / Leave / Ready (bool) / SetFloor (floor) / Start / Solo (floor) / Quit / Chest / Kick (userId)
	"DungeonState", -- server -> client (kind:string, payload:table)  Lobby / Run / Loot / Chest / End (<= 1 KB, <= 1/s per client)
	"ObbyPick", -- (levelId:string)  pick an obby level at the Obby gate (PortalService.PickLevel; unlocked levels only)
	"SettingsSet", -- (key:string, value:any)  Music / Sfx 0..10, Gfx "Auto"|"Low"|"High", Shake / MouseLock / FastHatch bool, SeenNotes int (DataService)
	"MenuPlay", -- ()  the main menu's PLAY: the server spawns the character (PlayerService.SpawnPlayer; first per session, 1/s)
	"QuickTravel", -- (dest:string) "Plaza" | "Altar"  "Plaza": the pill's Travel button, opens the home portal to the lobby; "Altar" (shop-area 16.17.3): the Shop's Secret card TRAVEL, straight to the Storm Altar's landing (GateService.Travel)
	-- store (2026-11-04; docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-04-shop-retention-design.md): the Store, the daily gifts, the Sky Trove
	"StoreRequest", -- (action:string, key:string)  "Buy" (a Config.Store.Items key) / "GemBuy" (a Config.Store.GemItems key)
	--   Buy: the server prompts the pass / product (the client never prompts); GemBuy: StoreService.BuyWithGems spends the gems
	"DailyRequest", -- (action:string, tier:number|nil)  "Claim" (the streak gift) / "ClaimPlay" (tier) / "ClaimPlayAll" (every Ready play tier, one toast) (DailyService)
	"DailyState", -- server -> client (state:table)  the streak, the resolved cells, the play clock and its tiers, Play.Active
	"TroveRequest", -- (action:string)  "Joined": the client's PromptJoinAsync answered Joined / AlreadyMember (TroveService checks once per visit)
